   "wikipedia": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Terrible_Certainty",
   "resumo_en": "Terrible Certainty is the third studio album by German thrash metal band Kreator, released in 1987 through Noise Records. It is the band's first album recorded as a four piece. It was released on CD, cassette, black vinyl, and as a limited edition red vinyl. The remastered version of 2000 contains the tracks of the 1988 Out of the Dark... Into the Light EP as bonus tracks. Another remastered version in 2 CDs was released on 9 June 2017, and included all the live tracks from the EP. The album has sold more than 100,000 copies."
