   "resumo_en": "Renewal is the sixth album by German thrash metal band Kreator, released in 1992. It's their first \"experimental\" album, as in this release Kreator incorporated industrial music influences in their songwriting. It is also the last album to feature original bassist Rob Fioretti. The song \"Karmic Wheel\" contains audio samples from the suicide of R. Budd Dwyer. \nA music video was made for the title track."
