   "wikipedia": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Outcast_%28Kreator_album%29",
   "resumo_en": "Outcast is the eighth studio album by German thrash metal band Kreator. It was released by G.U.N. Records in 1997. This album featured more gothic and industrial influences than earlier Kreator, retaining little of the thrash metal from previous years. Outcast is also Kreator's first album to feature drummer Jürgen \"Ventor\" Reil since 1992's Renewal, and the first to feature then-former Coroner guitarist Tommy Vetterli."
